  "aboutPageTitle": "Master Elf | The Rise of the Phoenix",
  "aboutBreadcrumb": "About Master Elf.",
  "aboutHeroHeadline": "Enrich Lives Through Heavenly Knowledge",
  "aboutBullet1": "It started with believe.",
